    "body": "## Question\n\nWhat does the real arm actually cost?\n\n## Task\n\n- List every part: arm kit, motors, driver board, power, camera, mounts, fasteners.\n- Price each with a link and a backup supplier.\n- Add a 15% buffer and state the total.\n\n## What you'll learn\n\n- Cheap arms hide cost in power, mounts, and spares.\n- Lead time is part of the plan.\n- Buy the spare servo before you need it.\n\n## Build\n\nFolder: `days/hardware-bom/` (hardware folder, created when the arm arrives)\nThis issue stays closed until hardware is on the desk. The simulator\ninterface is already fixed by Day 29, so there is no guesswork.\n\n## Video (30-60 s)\n\n- **0-15 s:** parts laid out on the desk\n- **15-40 s:** the cost table\n- **40-60 s:** the total, with the hidden extras called out\n\n## Done when\n\n- [ ] Task verified on real hardware\n- [ ] Folder committed\n- [ ] Video posted\n- [ ] Issue closed with the video link in a comment\n",
